        "original_id": "cece6006-944e-54b3-a425-87b449d2748c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joel Greenblatt, Michael O'Brien, Tom Waits, William Green, Warren Buffett, Charlie Munger, Bill Ackman\n- Companies: Pzena Investment Management\n- Concepts: Magic formula investing, value investing\n- Products: The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans, Hard Ground, The Great Minds of Investing\n\nFacts:\n- In 2003, Michael O'Brien completed \"The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans.\"\n- In 2011, Michael O'Brien completed \"Hard Ground,\" a book whose portraits of homeless individuals are paired with poems by Tom Waits.\n- In 2014, Michael O'Brien updated \"The Face of Texas: Portraits of Texans\" with 24 new photographs.\n- In 2015, Michael O'Brien completed \"The Great Minds of Investing,\" a collection of 33 portraits of famous investors including Warren Buffett, Charlie Munger, Joel Greenblatt, and Bill Ackman, with accompanying profiles written by William Green.\n- Magic formula investing is a term for an investment technique outlined by Joel Greenblatt that uses the principles of value investing.\n- Joel Greenblatt is also a director at Pzena Investment Management, a high-end value firm.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
